[h1]Material Search Overlay[/h1]

Search for anything by name and highlight matching things across your map.

[hr][/hr]

[h2]How to use[/h2]
[list]
[*]Open the overlay menu and click [b]Material Search Overlay[/b] (or use the assigned keybind)
[*]Type any part of a name into the search field
[*]Select a result from the dropdown, clearly marked with a type badge (e.g., Material, Critter, Equipment)
[*]Matching entities, tiles, buildings, debris, and natural backwalls light up on the map
[*]Non-matching cells are dimmed when viewing an element
[*]View exact breakdowns: element mass totals or total counts for entities and items
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

