[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Universal search by name:[/b] Single search box for materials, equipment, duplicants, bionic duplicants, boosters, critters, food, plants, industrial products, and artifacts.
[*][b]Custom overlay icon:[/b] Distinct magnifier icon on the overlay bar and legend.
[*][b]Type badges:[/b] Dropdown entries show exact entity categories to eliminate ambiguity.
[*][b]Real-time tracking:[/b] Highlighted moving entities (duplicants, critters) stay lit as they move across the colony.
[*][b]Mass totals & item counts:[/b] Elements report mass broken down by natural tiles, backwalls, debris, and buildings; other categories show total found counts.
[*][b]Fog of war safe:[/b] Only searches explored, revealed space without spoiling hidden map sections.
[*]15 languages supported using machine translation (en, zh, zht, fr, de, es, ru, ko, ja, th, vi, pt_BR, pl, cs, hu, uk) [b]Want to improve a translation or add a new one? [url=https://github.com/bobby-modding/bobby-oni-mod/tree/main/MaterialSearchOverlay/translations]Help out here![/url][/b] 
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]Supported Categories[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Materials:[/b] Element names (e.g. [i]GOLD[/i], [i]WATER[/i], [i]INSULATION[/i])
[*][b]Equipment:[/b] Prefab name (e.g. [i]Slick Suit[/i]; worn gear highlights the wearer)
[*][b]Duplicants & Bionics:[/b] Filter by model ([i]Standard Duplicant[/i] vs [i]Bionic Duplicant[/i], or [i]Duplicant[/i] for all)
[*][b]Boosters:[/b] Upgrade name (e.g. [i]Nutrient Loader[/i]; highlights both equipped duplicants and loose storage items)
[*][b]Critters:[/b] Species name (e.g. [i]Pacu[/i], [i]Puft[/i])
[*][b]Food & Plants:[/b] Food items, crops, seeds, wild plants, and mutants (e.g. [i]Mealwood[/i], [i]Raw Fish[/i])
[*][b]Industrial & Artifacts:[/b] Sandbox-equivalent industrial tags (e.g. [i]Steel[/i], [i]Coal[/i], medicine) and decor artifacts
[/list]

